# Score viewer

- Load Verovio only in Client Components via `next/dynamic(..., { ssr: false })`.
- Prefer `verovio/wasm` + `VerovioToolkit`: `loadZipDataBuffer` / `loadData` → `renderToSVG` per page.
- Lazy-load pages; do not SSR giant SVGs or import WASM on catalog list pages.
- Fetch score bytes from an app route that streams R2; honor `default_visible_parts`.
- Load SMuFL webfont on the viewer route only.
- Accessibility: real HTML title/composer; `aria` on the wrapper — SVG is not music for screen readers.
- OSMD is fallback only if WASM bundling fails; do not switch without updating `docs/decisions.md`.
